 explore the <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/request-new-features/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Request New Features page</a> to upvote ideas or add your own if it’s not already listed.</strong></p><p>Below, you’ll find a Roadmap of our latest and upcoming features and updates:</p><p><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">28th January 2025 </span>✅<em><br></em></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">MLS Soft Launch Date to Pioneers</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">12th February 2025 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong>✅</strong></span><em><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><strong><br></strong></span></em>MLS Launch Date to WhatsApp Groups with 2,500+ estate agents &amp; Public Release.</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">1st April 2025</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae9a;\">✅</span><br></strong>New Feature:&nbsp; Short-Term Rentals Launch</p><p><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">8th Feb 2026</span></span></strong><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">✅</span></strong><em><br></em>New Feature: <a href=\"https://ai.propertylist.es/how-it-works\">AI Property Report Agent</a></p><p><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">17th Feb 2026</span></span></strong><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">✅</span></strong><em style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></em><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">New Feature:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/new-developments/\" style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">New Developments</a><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<br><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">10th December 2025</span></strong><em><br></em>New Feature: <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/requests/\">ReQuests</a></p><p><br></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager first\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/technical-documentation/\">\n                    <span> MLS User Manual - Previous </span>\n\t\t\t\t\tTechnical Documentation                </a>\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/faq-mls/\">\n                    <span> Next - MLS User Manual </span>\n\t\t\t\t\tFAQ (MLS &amp; CRM)                </a>\n\t\t\t        </div>\n\t\t    </div>","seo_title":"New Features & Roadmap • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":"We are dedicated to providing our members with